on is known to aid with digestion, as it contains limonene, compounds that can assist with weight loss and fighting inflammation!", "reference": "2018, Sally Olivia Kim, “Vanilla Lemon Latte”, in The Collagen Glow: A Guide to Ingestible Skincare, New York, N.Y.: W. W. Norton & Company, →ISBN, “Hot and Cold Drinks” section:"}], "synonyms": [], "antonyms": [], "translations": [], "subsenses": []}, {"definition": "A lemon shark (Negaprion brevirostris).", "tags": ["countable", "usually"], "examples": [], "quotes": [], "synonyms": [], "antonyms": [], "translations": [], "subsenses": []}, {"definition": "(slang) A defective or inadequate item or individual.", "tags": ["countable", "slang", "usually"], "examples": ["He didn’t realise until he’d paid for it that the car was a lemon."], "quotes": [{"text": "“[…]the Navy's supposed to give me a ship that goes, and a captain that fights—— That's what all this muck is for, isn't it?”\n “Look, it's an old story by now. We're stuck with a lemon. Misfortune of war.[…]”", "reference": "1951, Herman Wouk, chapter 20, in The Caine Mutiny, page 243:"}], "synonyms": [], "antonyms": [], "translations": [], "subsenses": []}, {"definition": "(Cockney rhyming slang, shortened from “lemon flavour”) Favor.", "tags": ["Cockney", "countable", "slang", "usually"], "examples": ["A thousand quid for that motor? Do me a lemon! I could get it for half that."], "quotes": [], "synonyms": [], "antonyms": [], "translations": [], "subsenses": []}, {"definition": "(dated, fandom slang) A piece of fanfiction involving explicit sex.", "tags": ["countable", "dated", "slang", "usually"], "examples": [], "quotes": [{"text": "I'd really like to know what people think of this and whether I should carry on writing lemons or go and hide under a rock somewhere.", "reference": "1997 April 18, Neko, “[Dominion][FanFic][Lemon] A Typical Night at the Station”, in rec.arts.anime.creative (Usenet):"}, {"text": "WARNING: This story is a lemon and must be viewed with great care. If you are either under the age of 18, think graphic sex is discussing^([sic]) or you know what my writing is like you should turn away now.", "reference": "2000 May 30, Ian Blakeman, “[Eva][FanFic][Lemon] A day at Misatos appartment^([sic])”, in rec.arts.anime.creative (Usenet):"}, {"text": "This won't be a lemon simply because I can't see myself writing anything like that.", "reference": "2002 November 10, Goku Girl, “[DBZ][FanFic][Yaoi] Saiya-jin no Suto-ri Ichi (part one)”, in rec.arts.anime.creative (Usenet):"}], "synonyms": [], "antonyms": [], "translations": [], "subsenses": []}, {"definition": "(geometry) The surface of revolution of a circular arc of angle less than 180° rotated about the straight line passing through the arc’s two endpoints.", "tags": ["countable", "usually"], "examples": [], "quotes": [], "synonyms": [], "antonyms": [], "translations": [], "subsenses": []}], "synonyms": ["bomb", "PWP", "smutfic", "lemon yellow"], "antonyms": []}, {"language": {"code": "en", "name": "English"}, "partOfSpeech": "adjective", "pronunciations": [{"type": "ipa", "text": "/ˈlɛmən/", "tags": []}, {"type": "ipa", "text": "/ˈlɛmɪn/", "tags": []}, {"type": "ipa", "text": "/ˈlɪmɪn/", "tags": ["pin pen merger"]}], "forms": [{"word": "more lemon", "tags": ["comparative"]}, {"word": "most lemon", "tags": ["superlative"]}], "senses": [{"definition": "Containing or having the flavour/flavor and/or scent of lemons.", "tags": [], "examples": [], "quotes": [], "synonyms": [], "antonyms": [], "translations": [{"language": {"code": "bg", "name": "Bulgarian"}, "word": "лимонов"}, {"language": {"code": "fi", "name": "Finnish"}, "word": "sitruunan makuinen"}, {"language": {"code": "de", "name": "German"}, "word": "compounds with Zitrone"}, {"language": {"code": "el", "name": "Greek"}, "word": "λεμονί"}, {"language": {"code": "pl", "name": "Polish"}, "word": "cytrynowy"}, {"language": {"code": "pt", "name": "Portuguese"}, "word": "limoado"}, {"language": {"code": "sk", "n